cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite PairPulse when using this code or its numerical data."
type: software
title: "PairPulse: paired Dirac and quantum-kinetic solvers for pulsed-field pair creation"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ozalloum/PairPulse"
authors:
  - family-names: Zalloum
    given-names: Othman H. Y.
    affiliation: Palestine Polytechnic University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7282-1332"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for fermion pair creation in prescribed spatially
  homogeneous, time-dependent electric fields in 1+1 dimensions. Independent
  Dirac-mode and quantum-kinetic integrations are checked against the exact
  temporal Sauter-pulse result. The repository includes code, tests, a notebook,
  spectra, convergence diagnostics, figures, and manuscript materials.
keywords:
  - pair production
  - Dirac equation
  - quantum kinetic equations
  - Sauter pulse
  - reproducible computing
